WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
It will treat waste differently from today.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.060
The EU will see that companies will change their way of working.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:11.180
It will encourage companies to build things that last for years, not to break once a

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.140
guarantee ends.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:19.620
The European Union will also need people to change. It will ask whether people will choose quality

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:25.020
over convenience. The EU will see that this change is as important as the changes made

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:30.860
by companies or governments. The European Union will succeed if all parts work together.
